function Confectory.AlgorithmProjection::ApplyDelta (string snapshot, string delta) -> string { description "Apply only matching qualified scope, base version and view hash; validate replacement hash/scope/version. Duplicate application is idempotent. Rejected or out-of-order delivery preserves snapshot and requires refresh.";provide Confectory.AlgorithmProjection::ApplyDelta with Confectory.AlgorithmProjection::ApplyDeltaBody;}
